# on turn 3 animates Mox Ruby: the targets Bot1 can't choose are the Cookie (already a creature), Bot2's Mox Pearl (an opponent's) and
# a Plains (no artifact). The Mox is a 4/4 colorless Artifact Creature that attacks (it came in on turn 1, so it isn't summoning
# sick) for 4; on turn 5 the effect is over: just an artifact again.

